@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ===========================================
### PHASE 3 WORKFLOW TESTS - Teacher Interface
### ===========================================

### Step 1: Get all teachers (to get teacher ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teachers/getAll

### Step 2: Get all classes (to get class ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/getAll

### Step 3: Get all subjects (to get subject ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subject/getAll

### Step 4: Get students by class (to get student IDs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/class/1

### Step 5: Create a bulletin period
POST {{baseUrl}}/bulletin-periods/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Première période 2024-2025",
  "startDate": "2024-09-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endDate": "2024-12-15T23:59:59.999Z",
  "year": "2024-2025",
  "isActive": true
}

### Step 6: Get active bulletin periods
GET {{baseUrl}}/bulletin-periods/active

### Step 7: Get current bulletin period
GET {{baseUrl}}/bulletin-periods/current

### Step 8: Create an evaluation
POST {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Interrogation Mathématiques - Algèbre",
  "description": "Test sur les équations du second degré et les inéquations",
  "evaluationDate": "2025-01-15T10:00:00.000Z",
  "maxScore": 20,
  "coefficient": 1.5,
  "isVisible": true,
  "gradesVisible": false,
  "subjectId": 1,
  "classId": 1,
  "bulletinPeriodId": 1
}

### Step 9: Get evaluations by teacher (replace with actual teacher ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/teacher/1

### Step 10: Get visible evaluations by class and period
GET {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/visible/class/1/period/1

### Step 11: Get grades by evaluation (replace with actual evaluation ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/evaluation/1

### Step 12: Bulk save grades for the evaluation
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/bulk-save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "evaluationId": 1,
  "grades": [
    {
      "studentId": 1,
      "score": 15.5,
      "comment": "Très bon travail, maîtrise les concepts"
    },
    {
      "studentId": 2,
      "score": 12.0,
      "comment": "Effort à poursuivre, quelques lacunes"
    },
    {
      "studentId": 3,
      "score": 18.0,
      "comment": "Excellent, parfaite compréhension"
    }
  ]
}

### Step 13: Make grades visible to students
PUT {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/1/toggle-grades-visibility

### Step 14: Get coefficients by class
GET {{baseUrl}}/coefficients/class/1

### Step 15: Save coefficient for subject-class combination
POST {{baseUrl}}/coefficients/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subjectId": 1,
  "classId": 1,
  "coefficient": 2.5,
  "isActive": true
}

### Step 16: Get student grades for calculation
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/calculation/student/1/subject/1/period/1

### Step 17: Get student average
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/average/student/1/subject/1/period/1

### ===========================================
### CLEANUP (Optional - for testing only)
### ===========================================

### Delete evaluation (replace with actual ID)
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/1

### Delete bulletin period (replace with actual ID)  
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/bulletin-periods/1
